  "prefLabel": "Pes 301.04 Ornamental",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 301.04 “Ornamental” means trees, shrubs, and other plantings in and around habitations generally, but not necessarily located in urban and suburban areas, including residences, parks, streets, retail outlets, industrial, and institutional buildings.\n\nSource. #150, eff 1-9-74, amd by #1058.6, eff 11-22-77; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4309, eff 9-1-87; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #12756, eff 4-10-19 (formerly Pes 301.03); ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
